      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "1) On the open beta 1501, the action menu gesture reset issue is fixed. You'll need to reset your bindings or adjust them as needed. Though I now accidentally do gestures while navigating the action menu. see [the wiki](https://wiki.vrchat.com/wiki/Community:SteamVR_Bindings#Unwanted_Action_Menu_gestures) for a solution on that. (Also [feedback post](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1501-vive-controllers-unwanted-gesture-behavior-in-action-menu))\n\n2) Posing physbones is now part of the INTERACT action. (Default bound to trigger) See this [feedback post](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1491-vive-controllers-physbone-pose-w-trigger-full-pull-is-unintuitive) on this specific issue.",
