  "details": "After Assigning a gesture to Trigger on Vive wand (Vive Advanced control) And opening your Radial menu ends up disabling the gesture being held down.\n\nBefore the Update i would be able to open my radial while holding in a gesture On Vive wands.\n\nNow I have to use my left hand to use the radial menu while holding a gesture on my right hand if i want to do this and is very annoying.\n\nIf i accidently open my radial menu it would cancel out my whole animation and have to restart.\n\nIssue 2:\n\nI cannot figure out how to grab and pose Phys bones on my Vive Pro wands\n\nWhen i grab using my trigger i see the bone snap to my hand for a split second and flies back to its original state.\n\n(Could it be an Advanced Vive control settings issue?)",
